This sequence of emojis tells the story of **Snow White**.

**Brief explanation:**
- A Queen (👸🏡) is jealous of her stepdaughter's beauty (👑😠)
- She asks her magic mirror (🪞✨) who is the fairest
- Disguised, she gives Snow White a poisoned apple (👿🍎⚰️)
- Snow White falls into a death-like sleep, found by forest animals (🐻🐿️🐦)
- A prince's kiss (🤴😘💍) breaks the spell, and they live happily ever after (👸💖)

This is one of the most famous fairy tales from the **Brothers Grimm**, later popularized worldwide by Disney's 1937 animated film. [end of text]


